//
// GEMMA4-E2B Q4NX prefill compile-only smoke test: builds the 22 prefill ELFs
// through the AIR -> AIE -> aiecc -> Peano pipeline. No NPU dispatch and no
// weight data (weights are runtime BOs), so this is the signal CI can always
// give without the external Q4NX bundle. Pairs with run_npu2_compile.lit (the
// decode half) and run_npu2_prefill_sweep.lit (the timed half, which does need
// the weights).
//
// TWENTY-TWO, not Gemma3-4B's eight, and that count is the model: Gemma4 crosses
// two attention classes with two FFN widths, so every attention-shaped ELF is
// built at head_dim 256 AND 512 and every FFN-shaped one at 6144 AND 12288,
// plus the three per-layer-embedding stages Gemma3 does not have.
//
// peano_ge22, not just peano: the repo's pinned llvm-aie (21.0.0) compiles this
// model and then returns all-NaN, the same reason the decode lits carry it.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, peano_ge22
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_npu2_compile_prefill
// RUN: cd test_npu2_compile_prefill
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile-prefill PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
//
// Both attention classes by name, not just "it compiled": head_dim=512 is the
// one shape no other model here builds, and a regression that dropped the full
// layers back to 256 would otherwise leave this test green.
// CHECK: rms_q_swa
// CHECK: rms_q_full
// CHECK: flash_attn_swa
// CHECK: flash_attn_full
// CHECK: Compilation passed.
